{
    "title": "Yelp for Business",
    "description": "Planning to start a business or already have a growing business? Explore one of the top business apps to help you attract more customers! \r\n\r\n<b>Claim your free Yelp business listing to get discovered by millions of people ready to buy, visit and hire! Yelp for Business makes online business advertising easy!</b>\r\n\r\nYelp gets 90+ million visitors each month searching for restaurants, home services and other businesses. Marketing on Yelp makes it easy to connect & reach customers, get more new leads  or provide customer service more quickly.  <b>Upgrade to Yelp Ads </b> for more advertising services, business suite of tools and extra benefits for your Yelp page!\r\n\r\n<b>Build trust with customers by updating your Yelp business listing information anytime! </b>\r\n   \u25fe     Easily manage your Yelp business account\r\n   \u25fe     Add contact information: phone number, address, and website\r\n   \u25fe     Update business hours, service area & current offerings\r\n   \u25fe     Upload your best photos to make a great first impression\r\n\r\n<b>Connect & Reach Customers with Ads! </b>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \r\n   \u25fe     Set up notifications so you never miss a lead\r\n   \u25fe     Receive and reply to customer messages or requests \r\n   \u25fe     Get notified and respond when your customers post Yelp reviews\r\n   \u25fe     Offer yelp reservations booking to your patrons\r\n   \u25fe     Get requests to schedule appointments or quotes\r\n   \u25fe     Get free customer support!     \r\n\r\n<b>Are you a growing business? Reach 3x more customers with Yelp Ads</b>\r\n   \u25fe     Easy to use Yelp ads manager marketing app\r\n   \u25fe     Create your business ad within minutes & advertise your business on Yelp\r\n   \u25fe     Keep it local! Target customers in areas you choose\r\n   \u25fe     Track your Yelp Ads results and see how your advertising reaches customers\r\n   \u25fe     Business suite of tools to help a growing business\r\n   \u25fe     Easily add business as you grow\r\n\r\n<b> Restaurant & Food Services - Get more reservations, order requests and food delivery services from our partners </b>\r\n   \u25fe     GrubHub \r\n   \u25fe     ChowNow\r\n   \u25fe     EatStreet\r\n   \u25fe     Delivery.com\r\n\r\n<b> Take advantage of Yelp\u2019s high intent diner audience with powerful solutions that simplify and streamline restaurant operations. </b>\r\n  \u25fe    Upgrade and enjoy a smoother FOH with Waitlist, Reservations, Table Management, To-Go, dedicated support, and analytics from Yelp Guest Manager.\r\n  \u25fe    Build relationships with a digital guestbook, two-way SMS, and exportable data for marketing campaigns\r\n\r\n<b> Beauty & Hair Services - Grow you client book with easy appointment booking online - available with one of our salon scheduler partners </b>\r\n   \u25fe     Booksy\r\n   \u25fe     Vagaro\r\n   \u25fe     Booker\r\n\r\n<b> List your business free on Yelp today! </b>\r\n\r\n<b> Business not listed on Yelp, yet? No problem! start a business page for free now, visit: https://www.biz.yelp.com/signup  </b>\r\n\r\n<b> NOTE: This app is for owners and managers to claim their Yelp Business Page. If you\u2019re looking for the Yelp app that will help you discover great local businesses, go to https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.yelp.android  </b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Planning to start a business or already have a growing business? Explore one of the top business apps to help you attract more customers! <br><br><b>Claim your free Yelp business listing to get discovered by millions of people ready to buy, visit and hire! Yelp for Business makes online business advertising easy!</b><br><br>Yelp gets 90+ million visitors each month searching for restaurants, home services and other businesses. Marketing on Yelp makes it easy to connect &amp; reach customers, get more new leads  or provide customer service more quickly.  <b>Upgrade to Yelp Ads </b> for more advertising services, business suite of tools and extra benefits for your Yelp page!<br><br><b>Build trust with customers by updating your Yelp business listing information anytime! </b><br>   \u25fe     Easily manage your Yelp business account<br>   \u25fe     Add contact information: phone number, address, and website<br>   \u25fe     Update business hours, service area &amp; current offerings<br>   \u25fe     Upload your best photos to make a great first impression<br><br><b>Connect &amp; Reach Customers with Ads! </b>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   <br>   \u25fe     Set up notifications so you never miss a lead<br>   \u25fe     Receive and reply to customer messages or requests <br>   \u25fe     Get notified and respond when your customers post Yelp reviews<br>   \u25fe     Offer yelp reservations booking to your patrons<br>   \u25fe     Get requests to schedule appointments or quotes<br>   \u25fe     Get free customer support!     <br><br><b>Are you a growing business? Reach 3x more customers with Yelp Ads</b><br>   \u25fe     Easy to use Yelp ads manager marketing app<br>   \u25fe     Create your business ad within minutes &amp; advertise your business on Yelp<br>   \u25fe     Keep it local! Target customers in areas you choose<br>   \u25fe     Track your Yelp Ads results and see how your advertising reaches customers<br>   \u25fe     Business suite of tools to help a growing business<br>   \u25fe     Easily add business as you grow<br><br><b> Restaurant &amp; Food Services - Get more reservations, order requests and food delivery services from our partners </b><br>   \u25fe     GrubHub <br>   \u25fe     ChowNow<br>   \u25fe     EatStreet<br>   \u25fe     Delivery.com<br><br><b> Take advantage of Yelp\u2019s high intent diner audience with powerful solutions that simplify and streamline restaurant operations. </b><br>  \u25fe    Upgrade and enjoy a smoother FOH with Waitlist, Reservations, Table Management, To-Go, dedicated support, and analytics from Yelp Guest Manager.<br>  \u25fe    Build relationships with a digital guestbook, two-way SMS, and exportable data for marketing campaigns<br><br><b> Beauty &amp; Hair Services - Grow you client book with easy appointment booking online - available with one of our salon scheduler partners </b><br>   \u25fe     Booksy<br>   \u25fe     Vagaro<br>   \u25fe     Booker<br><br><b> List your business free on Yelp today! </b><br><br><b> Business not listed on Yelp, yet? No problem! start a business page for free now, visit: https://www.biz.yelp.com/signup  </b><br><br><b> NOTE: This app is for owners and managers to claim their Yelp Business Page. If you\u2019re looking for the Yelp app that will help you discover great local businesses, go to https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.yelp.android  </b>",
